 "balance": {
  "_doc": "r03 mix-stage balance (lib/balance.py), measured on the placed stems: melodies at least margin_dB over the loudest other stem (lift at most lift_max_dB, the rest as cuts on the competing stems, at most duck_max_dB), melody at least sum_margin_dB against the power sum of the others; timpani in rolls longer than a bar at least roll_margin_dB under the loudest other stem. r04: duck_same_dB caps the cut on a stem printed at the melody's dynamic (stems printed louder are never cut, softer at most duck_max_dB); tutti_frac: a bar is a tutti when at least this share of sounding stems is printed f or louder (no cuts; a melody phrase ends there when the melody is printed f or louder); preserve_dB: each bar's summed loudness stays within this of the no-balance bar; smooth_s 1.25 (fader slope a few dB/s); inv_margin_dB: a melody is lifted at most to this many dB over a sounding stem printed louder than it",
